&lt;p&gt;SumUp recently invested in a full brand refresh, giving the business a distinctive new voice with real momentum behind it. The Global Content Chapter, more than 10 content managers working across the organisation, is ready for someone to take that voice further: to shape it into clear frameworks, champion it across every market and channel, and raise the bar for what great content at SumUp looks like. This is a chance to build and own that standard from the ground up, working closely with Marketing, Design and Product to make sure SumUp&#39;s words are as sharp and distinctive as its products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce editorial standards across the Global Content Chapter, giving direct feedback that sharpens ideas and cuts unnecessary revision rounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, edit and approve copy across campaigns, social, CRM, retail and sales, making sure every piece is on brand and commercially clear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the verbal identity system: tone of voice guidelines, messaging hierarchies, approved terminology and channel specific guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Design, Marketing, Product and regional teams to turn briefs into clear creative direction for internal writers and freelancers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief, manage and quality control freelance copywriters and external agencies to protect brand integrity in outsourced work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate AI writing tools and set standards for their responsible use, so the team works efficiently without losing quality or distinctiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold a portfolio that demonstrates distinctive, commercially effective writing across brand, campaign and digital formats, not just competent copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have personally defined, documented and enforced a tone of voice across a complex organisation, rather than simply contributing to someone else&#39;s guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of content strategy beyond execution: building messaging hierarchies and editorial frameworks that others can follow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience giving direct, constructive feedback that raises the standard of a content team&#39;s output over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort moving between strategic work (standards, systems) and hands on execution when a piece needs senior creative judgement to get it over the line&lt;/li&gt;
